  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2077\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2077</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2077\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=KIr&amp;datanum=2077\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2077\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2077\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>MBL 센서가 이제 저렴해졌어요.</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커(ez-maker)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">위 글을 먼저 읽어보시고,</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"> <b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커 - 이산화탄소센서</span></b> </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커(ez-maker)로</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">입김에 있는 이산화탄소량 측정을 해보았어요.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커 사용 테스트 실험으로서</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">가장 쉬운 실험</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">나의 입김에는 얼마만큼의</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이산화탄소가 있나요??</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">간단하게 블록코딩을 합니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커 사이트의 이지온을 클릭하여&#160;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">블록코딩을 간한하게 합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/383cb53657d2c59c15236121d9570b6a9b5bd69e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/383cb53657d2c59c15236121d9570b6a9b5bd69e\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"445\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그리고</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">미니보드에 이산화탄소 센서를 연결합니다</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그런데....</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a50b18581f48c2d984a30472efa75b93ba42505\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a50b18581f48c2d984a30472efa75b93ba42505\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"437\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커 미니보드는 빨간불이 안들어와서</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">(센서말고 보드에 파란불이 들어와서)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">뭔가 잘못되었나</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">설명서를 다 읽어봅니다 ㅠ</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">실험하기전에 설명서를 읽어보니</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">보드에 빨간색이 들어와야 한다고...</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">계속 설명서를 읽어봅니다 ㅠ</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">파란불에 대한 내용이 안나옵니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">안나오니</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그냥 실험해봅니다ㅜ </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">실험이 됩니다 ㅠ</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">보드 파란불이 나와도 됩니다ㅠ</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">설명서에는</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">미니보드가 아닌 메인보드로 설명이 되어 있는 빨간불이 들어 와야 한다고 되어 있어서 ㅠ</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20c54ba741c1aa984c0dec2d42bc2e79bbeda59c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20c54ba741c1aa984c0dec2d42bc2e79bbeda59c\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"437\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">미니보드 파란불</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/800ee37f1d0ce3b9623090f977378551b9708864\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/800ee37f1d0ce3b9623090f977378551b9708864\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"437\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이산화탄소 측정 센서 빨간등</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">측정하니</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">바로 그래프가 그려지며 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">데이터가 모여집니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7ac6274079f041626d1c1a32a6776e61845119b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7ac6274079f041626d1c1a32a6776e61845119b\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"440\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">처음량이 1000ppm 나오네요</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a965ed205d0d7ad484e80d258c808c4c1c9f842a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a965ed205d0d7ad484e80d258c808c4c1c9f842a\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"266\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">장시간 밀폐된 집안에서 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">노트북 앞에서 놀다보니</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이렇게 올라 갔나?</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">입김을 강하게 수십번 불어 넣습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이산화탄소 측정 센서에다가</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그러니</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52d86f8bbfaf09b43eca7a7b4ec3775c1304a64a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52d86f8bbfaf09b43eca7a7b4ec3775c1304a64a\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"440\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">최고값이</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">13749ppm 이 나옵니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그리고</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">시간이 지나니</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">다시 원래대로 돌아가는 곡선이 나옵니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">데이터도 쉽게 다운 받을 수 있고</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">가격도 저렴한 MBL 실험 장비입니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b423b9b8345d4517a6bf0a2244fd03250823770\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b423b9b8345d4517a6bf0a2244fd03250823770\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"635\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>내가 입김을 불어 넣었어~~</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style5\"><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커 - 자기장센서</span></b></span></p><p>이제 한번 해봤다고</p><p>그냥</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>간단하게 끼우고</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d18320cba95e2da1fa1aff2e0f0afa1dd5509d00\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d18320cba95e2da1fa1aff2e0f0afa1dd5509d00\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"437\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>간단하게 블록코딩하면</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e6fdd08fc847099b8f2c3757194a419852f53fa\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e6fdd08fc847099b8f2c3757194a419852f53fa\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"469\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>데이터가 들어온다</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ebbc2c8b517bef8ff17293962034ffc167672bc\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ebbc2c8b517bef8ff17293962034ffc167672bc\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"473\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">자기장이 급격히 올라가는 구간은</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">어항 기포기 근처에 센서를 가져가니 올라간 것이다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">기포기는 모터가 있는 것이니 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">당연 영구자석이 있을 듯!!</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그리고 그 뒤 일정하게 되는 구간에서</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">전자레인지를 돌리고 겉에서 측정했는데</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">올라가지 않고 일정하게 되는 구간이 나타난다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">전자레인지가 자기장 차폐가 잘된다는 것인가?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">아니면 전자기 측정이 잘 안되고 자기장만 잘 되는 것인가??</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">전자레인지는</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">광센서를 다시 한번 해봐야겠다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">데이터 수집시 즉각적으로 데이터가 눈에 보이게 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그래프로 그려진다는 것 좋다!!!</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style5\"><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커 - 미세먼지 센서</span></b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93ec9f63defc5eeeee316e24298054ff2cce43bb\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93ec9f63defc5eeeee316e24298054ff2cce43bb\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"437\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28533f3b7209f98f5dc17fe0b07698dfda12360b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28533f3b7209f98f5dc17fe0b07698dfda12360b\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"437\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30ffe5c147094ece6a4ed2070aa27a805f4ca4c5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30ffe5c147094ece6a4ed2070aa27a805f4ca4c5\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"437\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">오~</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">살짝 어두워 보이는데서 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">불빛이 빨강 파랑이니깐 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">뭔가 있어보이는 사진</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f514270144201fec6078d850ba6d6e0477946621\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f514270144201fec6078d850ba6d6e0477946621\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"463\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">간단하게 블록코딩으로</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3가지 미세먼지(미세먼지,초미세먼지,극초미세먼지)를 측정하게 한다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1초간격으로 </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">데이터 수집</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecf4961a87df7951734d6fd286ced283308e9533\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecf4961a87df7951734d6fd286ced283308e9533\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"472\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">데이터를 모은다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">태블릿과 연결</span></b></span></p><p>학생들은 노트북이 없고 디벗이 있으니</p><p>태블릭 연결을 해봐야 한다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">태블릿패드와</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">C to C 케이블로 연결</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">인터넷으로 EZ-ON 으로 들어가니</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">소스 컴파일이 안된다</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">계속해도 해도 해도 안된다 ㅠㅠ</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">컴파일이 안된다 ㅠㅠ</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그래서</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이지메이커 홈페이지</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">학습하기-다운로드-</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&quot;EZ-ON 이지온(안드로이드) 다운로드/다운로드 방법&quot; 게시물에 들어가</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">앱을 다운 받는다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">앱이 앱스토어 있는 앱이 아니라</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">보안상 문제 있다고 뜨는데</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">무시하고 설정 풀어</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">설치하면 된다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">태블릿에서</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">앱으로 EZ-ON을 실행 후</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">소스 컴파일하면 실행이 잘 된다</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb0285d253fb3d35d44d75dd9035c51281307525\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb0285d253fb3d35d44d75dd9035c51281307525\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1851\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/670ad8b265c614ec4eaab66f9e63ac83f04e319a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/670ad8b265c614ec4eaab66f9e63ac83f04e319a\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1851\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이제</p><p>물리 실험을 해야 할 것 같다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>가장 기본적인 자유낙하실험이</p><p>이지메이커 총판하는 사이트에 게시되어 있는데</p><p><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/the20thdays/223332561121\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://blog.naver.com/the20thdays/223332561121</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"지능형과학실험ON 이지메이커로 질량에 따른 자유 낙하 운동속력 측정하기 실험으로 코딩교육을\" data-og-description=\"안녕하세요 지능형과학실ON과 연동되는 이지메이커 총판 더스무날 입니다 ! 오늘은 지능형과학실험ON ...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/the20thdays/223332561121\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/the20thdays/223332561121\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ciN1Zw/hyXC9RJTpg/R52xlqmh01KrB0o9k9am40/img.jpg?width=743&amp;height=418&amp;face=0_0_743_418\"><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/the20thdays/223332561121\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/the20thdays/223332561121\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ciN1Zw/hyXC9RJTpg/R52xlqmh01KrB0o9k9am40/img.jpg?width=743&amp;height=418&amp;face=0_0_743_418\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">지능형과학실험ON 이지메이커로 질량에 따른 자유 낙하 운동속력 측정하기 실험으로 코딩교육을</p><p class=\"og-desc\">안녕하세요 지능형과학실ON과 연동되는 이지메이커 총판 더스무날 입니다 ! 오늘은 지능형과학실험ON ...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p>위 사이트를 보면, 전류로 측정하는 듯 하다;;;</p><p>DIY1-B 센서가 뭔지 잘 모른데</p><p>찾아보니 전도현상을 이용하여 실험 장치를 제작할 수 있는 센서라는데;;;;</p><p>DIY1-B 센서 2개로 측정이 가능하다고 한다;;;;;;;;;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이거 어떻게 하는 거지??</p><p>사진을 들여다봐도 이거 누가 설명해주지 않고서는&#160;</p><p>너무 막연하다 ㅠㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그래서</p><p>이를 해결하기 위해...</p><p>&#160;</p><p>나름</p><p>무엇인가를 꾸민다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>-지능형과학실ON과도 아직 별로 친하지 않는데;;;</p><p>센서들과 먼저 친해지자고 만지작 거리고 있는 상황</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이지메이커와 지능형과학실ON 둘다 친해져야 한다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>다음회에 계속~</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
